; FlashGold v5 EA preset: SPX500 1m, VT costs. Best cell of the exit sweep (see README).
; Run on SPX500, chart timeframe M1. Zones: chart, M2, M4, M10 with 3 aligned. MT5 has no 8m -> M10 timeframe (nearest at or above used).
